// EASCape: Draynor Village's seed stalls (Seeds, Bankspace And Advisors, 6 June 2005). The OSRS
// wiki's Seed Stall page: level 27, 10 xp, the loot and its weights out of 1000 (the drop log).
// Its respawn was 9 seconds (15 ticks) before 8 May 2024; doubled like our other stalls (ours).
// Olivia owns them and the Draynor market guards watch them (the wiki; 2009scape's
// StallThiefPulse has guards 2236 shout too).
[stealing_seed_stall]
